3:T1ef4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price","url":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price","name":"Why Parle Share Price Is Trending Today After PM Modi’s Viral Melody Moment","description":"This viral moment clearly shows how social media trends can quickly impact the stock market. Investors should avoid buying stocks only after seeing viral news or hype online. Before investing in any stock, always do proper research and understand the company details carefully.","inLanguage":"en-IN","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price#primaryimage"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price#breadcrumb"},"datePublished":"2026-05-23","dateModified":"2026-05-25","speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1","#ai-snapshot",".post-content p:first-of-type"]},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","audienceType":"Digital Marketing Professionals, SEO Experts","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India"}},"potentialAction":{"@type":"ReadAction","target":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price"}},{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price#article","headline":"Why Parle Share Price Is Trending Today After PM Modi’s Viral Melody Moment","name":"Why Parle Share Price Is Trending Today After PM Modi’s Viral Melody Moment","description":"This viral moment clearly shows how social media trends can quickly impact the stock market. Investors should avoid buying stocks only after seeing viral news or hype online. Before investing in any stock, always do proper research and understand the company details carefully.","datePublished":"2026-05-23","dateModified":"2026-05-25","author":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#person/kapil-kumar","name":"Kapil Kumar","url":"https://chatwizs.com/author/kapil-kumar","image":"/uploads/media-1779256004256-409405479.jpeg","jobTitle":"Tech and non-Tech Content Writer","description":"","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/prasantbagriya/","https://prashantbagriya.graphy.com/"]},"publisher":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#organization"},"image":["/uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png","/uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png?ar=1x1","/uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png?ar=4x3","/uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png?ar=16x9"],"mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price"},"articleBody":"Hello friends, here is the latest update for you all. As we all know, Prime Minister Narendra Modi ji recently went on a foreign trip where a viral moment with Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni grabbed huge attention on social media. Reports say that PM Modi gifted the famous Melody toffee to Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni during the meeting, and the clip soon went viral online.After this viral video started trending on social media, many people began searching for Parle-related stocks, which suddenly pushed Parle Industries share price into the spotlight. Since morning, the stock has been trending heavily among retail investors and across business news platforms.Why Parle Industries Share Price Suddenly Jumped After the Viral Melody MomentEveryone is excited to know the reason behind the sudden increase in the Parle Industries share price. The main reason behind this rally is the viral moment when Prime Minister Narendra Modi gifted the famous Melody toffee to Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni during his foreign visit.&nbsp;After the clip went viral on social media, many people started searching for Parle-related stocks and rushed to buy Parle Industries shares. However, the interesting fact is that Melody is actually made by Parle Products, which is a privately owned company and is not listed on the stock market. This confusion created a huge buzz among retail investors today.How PM Modi and Giorgia Meloni’s Viral Video Triggered the Parle Stock BuzzThe viral video of Prime Minister Narendra Modi and Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni quickly became a hot topic on social media. Reports claimed that PM Modi gifted the famous Melody toffee during the meeting, and soon the clip started trending online. As people saw the word “Parle” linked with the viral moment, many investors began searching for Parle-related stocks. This sudden excitement created huge buzz in the market and pushed Parle Industries share price sharply higher in a short time. Interestingly, Melody is made by Parle Products, which is not a listed company, but the viral social media trend still boosted investor interest today.Who Really Makes Melody Toffee? Here’s the Truth Behind the Parle NameThis is the big confusion among the people today. Many investors believe that Parle Industries is the company behind the famous Melody toffee, but that is not true. Melody is actually made by Parle Products, the well-known FMCG company famous for Parle-G biscuits, Mango Bite, KrackJack, and other popular snacks.&nbsp;However, Parle Products is a privately owned company and is not listed on the stock market. Meanwhile, Parle Industries is a separate listed company with no direct connection to Melody candies. The similar “Parle” name created confusion among retail investors after the viral PM Modi and Meloni moment.Why Retail Investors Rushed to Buy Parle Shares After the Viral ClipAs PM Modi gifted the Melody toffee during his meeting with Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni, the clip quickly became viral on social media. After seeing the trending video, many retail investors started searching for Parle-related stocks and rushed to buy Parle Industries shares. This sudden buzz increased buying activity in the stock market. However, many people later realised that Melody is actually made by Parle Products, which is not a listed company.Parle Products and Parle Industries Are Different&nbsp; Here’s Why the Confusion HappenedAfter the news came that PM Modi gifted Melody toffee to Giorgia Meloni, everyone started searching about Parle on social media and Google. But the real thing is that many people became confused between Parle Products and Parle Industries.&nbsp;Parle Products is the company that actually makes Melody, Parle-G, Mango Bite, and other famous snacks, but it is not listed on the stock market. Meanwhile, Parle Industries is a separate listed company with no direct connection to Melody candies.&nbsp;Due to the similar “Parle” name and the viral social media buzz, many retail investors rushed to buy Parle Industries shares, which increased the stock’s attention today.ConclusionThis viral moment clearly shows how social media trends can quickly impact the stock market. Investors should avoid buying stocks only after seeing viral news or hype online. Before investing in any stock, always do proper research and understand the company details carefully.","keywords":"Why Parle Share Price","wordCount":680,"timeRequired":"PT4M","inLanguage":"en-IN","isAccessibleForFree":true,"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India","sameAs":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q668"}},"reviewedBy":{"@type":"Person","name":"Prasant Bagriya","jobTitle":"Editorial Reviewer"},"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"Stock Market"}],"mentions":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"Why Parle Share Price"}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://chatwizs.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Stock Market","item":"https://chatwizs.com/category/stock market"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Why Parle Share Price Is Trending Today After PM Modi’s Viral Melody Moment","item":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/why-parle-share-price"}]}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"itemScope":true,"itemType":"https://schema.org/BlogPosting","style":{"width":"100%","maxWidth":"1200px","margin":"0 auto"},"children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"preload","as":"image","href":"/uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png","fetchPriority":"high","imageSizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","imageSrcSet":"/uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png?w=640 640w, /uploads/media-1779701638661-507832777.png?w=1200 1200w"}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4","$L5","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L6","$L7","$L8"]}],["$L9"],"$La"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"Vxk5xXQ5W-u6H8hrh6BZN"}
