e:["$","div",null,{"id":"intro","className":"tiptap-content","style":{"marginBottom":"3rem"},"itemProp":"articleBody","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Hello friends, here is the latest update for you all. As we all know, Prime Minister Narendra Modi ji recently went on a foreign trip where a viral moment with Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni grabbed huge attention on social media. Reports say that PM Modi gifted the famous Melody toffee to Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni during the meeting, and the clip soon went viral online."}]}],["$","p","1",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"After this viral video started trending on social media, many people began searching for Parle-related stocks, which suddenly pushed Parle Industries share price into the spotlight. Since morning, the stock has been trending heavily among retail investors and across business news platforms."}]}],["$","h1","2",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Why Parle Industries Share Price Suddenly Jumped After the Viral Melody Moment"}]}]}],["$","p","3",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"Everyone is excited to know the reason behind the sudden increase in the Parle Industries share price. The main reason behind this rally is the viral moment when Prime Minister Narendra Modi gifted the famous Melody toffee to Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni during his foreign visit. "}]}],["$","p","4",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"After the clip went viral on social media, many people started searching for Parle-related stocks and rushed to buy Parle Industries shares. However, the interesting fact is that Melody is actually made by Parle Products, which is a privately owned company and is not listed on the stock market. This confusion created a huge buzz among retail investors today."}]}],["$","h2","5",{"id":"h2-how-pm-modi-and-giorgia-melonis-viral-video-trigge-0","children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PM Modi and Giorgia Meloni’s Viral Video Triggered the Parle Stock Buzz"}]}]}],["$","p","6",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"The viral video of Prime Minister Narendra Modi and Italy’s PM Giorgia Meloni quickly became a hot topic on social media. Reports claimed that PM Modi gifted the famous Melody toffee during the meeting, and soon the clip started trending online. As people saw the word “Parle” linked with the viral moment, many investors began searching for Parle-related stocks. This sudden excitement created huge buzz in the market and pushed Parle Industries share price sharply higher in a short time. Interestingly, Melody is made by Parle Products, which is not a listed company, but the viral social media trend still boosted investor interest today."}]}],["$","h2","7",{"id":"h2-who-really-makes-melody-toffee-heres-the-truth-beh-1","children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who Really Makes Melody Toffee? Here’s the Truth Behind the Parle Name"}]}]}],["$","p","8",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"This is the big confusion among the people today. Many investors believe that Parle Industries is the company behind the famous Melody toffee, but that is not true. Melody is actually made by Parle Products, the well-known FMCG company famous for Parle-G biscuits, Mango Bite, KrackJack, and other popular snacks. "}]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b"]}]
f:["$","div",null,{"className":"author-bio-links","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"href":"/author/kapil-kumar","className":"author-bio-link","children":"View all articles →"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://prashantbagriya.graphy.com/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"author-bio-link","children":"Portfolio ↗"}],"",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/prasantbagriya/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"author-bio-link","children":"LinkedIn ↗"}]]}]
