1b:["$","p","17",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"18px"},"children":"This viral moment clearly shows how social media trends can quickly impact the stock market. Investors should avoid buying stocks only after seeing viral news or hype online. Before investing in any stock, always do proper research and understand the company details carefully."}]}]
